      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "You hold Amiya's hand.\nThe two of you look up at the sky together."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Rumble. Rumble. Rumble.\nEven the nearby cities feel the vibration, not just Londinium.\nA massive object, the likes of which has never been seen before, rises up from the dark clouds.\nBehind it, the thick clouds atop The Shard finally crack open. Those who have raised their heads to look up finally realize it was no ordinary cloud that surrounded Londinium."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "It was a Catastrophe cloud, far more massive than what any Catastrophe Messenger has ever recorded.\nSparks fly out of the overcharged black clouds, rumbling like thunder.\nThe strange flying machine is like the eye of the storm.\nBeneath its gaze, there is nowhere for the enemies of the Sarkaz to run."
        },
